&lt;li&gt;Admitted as solicitor or barrister in Hong Kong or Singapore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Iog9dHODIo3qljxJt6ElZIcIgCf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
