&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXWKdgb7poEdQtxh4a6lZkytgRh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prosecutorial or criminal enforcement background (prosecutor, government trial lawyer, or criminal/regulatory enforcement counsel), plus arbitration and trial experience and a track record leading a team. Prior in-house experience preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ty0Qdam8yomLmpxmKbplDCPEg3e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
